Hei, Marie!

24
00:02:26,930 --> 00:02:29,890
-Urca in masina, nenorocito!
-Nu!

25
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:31,060
In masina, nu auzi?

26
00:02:31,190 --> 00:02:32,560
Lasama in pace.

27
00:02:32,690 --> 00:02:35,030
-Haide, stii ca te iubesc.
-Cacat!

28
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:37,610
O sa urci in masina!

29
00:02:47,410 --> 00:02:50,620
'Si chiar acolo, langa stalpul luminat,

30
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:53,500
