-Hei! Hei!
-Oh, cacat! S'o tulim.

66
00:05:50,470 --> 00:05:52,760
'asta e tatal meu. Lorenzo Anello.'

67
00:05:53,350 --> 00:05:58,400
'Traseul lui este pe strada 187 si 
mie imi placea sa merg alaturi de el.'

68
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:01,520
'Asta sunt eu, Calogero, la noua ani.'

69
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,800
-Pe mai tarziu, tata.
-OK.

70
00:06:31,970 --> 00:06:34,390
-Urca sus baiete.
-OK, tata.

71
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:35,640
'Ea este mama, Rosina.'

72
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:38,140
'L'a intalnit pe tata la o serata.'

73
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,850
'Si de atunci sunt nedespartiti.'

74
00:06:49,650 --> 00:06:52,370

75
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:57,220

76
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,340
'The Chez Bippy.
Locul unde se strangea gasca.'

77
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:43,310
'Tony Toupee era patron doar cu numele.'

78
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:46,150
'Sonny era sefu.'

79
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:51,320
'Tony mai canta, dar toata lumea il ignora.'

80
00:08:51,900 --> 00:08:56,280
'De ciuda, niciodata nu vorbea, ci doar canta.'

81
00:08:56,410 --> 00:09:02,080
'Il poreclisera Tony Toupee datorita lipsei de par.'

82
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,960
'Eddie Terci era cartoforul.'

83
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,630
'Era cel mai mare looser.'

84
00:09:08,750 --> 00:09:11,550
'Tot ce atingea se transforma in terci.'

85
00:09:11,670 --> 00:09:13,510
Am nevoie de un as.

86
00:09:13,630 --> 00:09:15,050
'Mai mergea sa parieze,

87
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:17,590
si casierul ii dadae bilete necastigatoare.'

88
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,510
Am pariat pe Yankee's, dar au pierdut.

89
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:22,810
Daca n'a fost ghinion, atunci nu am noroc deloc.'

90
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:25,600
'Georgio balena.'

91
00:09:25,730 --> 00:09:29,020
'Cum se spunea, daca'l intalneai pe strada,
mai bine il sareai decat sa'l ocolesti.

93
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:31,940
'Il vedeai mai gras cu fiecare ora ce trecea.'

94
00:09:33,110 --> 00:09:36,070
'Legenda spunea, ca umbra lui a omorat un caine.'

95
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,780
'Frankie Placinta-cu-cacao.'

96
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:44,200
'Il poreclisera asa pentru ca 
fata lui semana cu una.'

97
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:46,750
'Cu greu te puteai uita la moaca lui.'

98
00:09:59,590 --> 00:10:01,550
OK, pustiule, unde te duci?

99
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:07,310
'Numele lui era Jimmy Soapta, 
si era mana dreapta a lui Sonny.'

100
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:10,400
'Totul era un secret pentru el.'

101
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:17,530
David KO ii caftea pe baieti,

102
00:10:17,650 --> 00:10:19,820
si Bobby Gratii, care si'a petrecut
jumatate de viata in spatele lor.'

103
00:10:20,950 --> 00:10:24,620
'Astia erau baietii lui Sonny si nimeni nu se punea cu ei.'

104
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,460
Ce naiba faci aici?

105
00:10:27,580 --> 00:10:32,840
Nu ti'am spus ca nu ai ce cauta aici?
Nu ti'am spus sa vii sus?

106
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:35,630
Stai sa vina tac'tu.
Ce cautai aici?

107
00:10:35,710 --> 00:10:36,720
Il cautam pe tata.

108
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,380
Pe el il cautai? Interesant.

109
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:44,510
Trebuie sa ma duc pana la bacanie.
Sa nu te misti de aici.

110
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:46,270
M'ai auzit?

111
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:50,730
Tot ce vedea, la Sonny imitam,

112
00:10:50,850 --> 00:10:54,110
dar el tot nu avea ochi pentru mine.

113
00:10:57,740 --> 00:11:01,490
Sonny avea cinci degete, dar nu folosea decat trei.

114
00:11:04,490 --> 00:11:07,160
Sa mergem. Misca sus.

115
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:16,550
nu vreau friptura.

116
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:18,920
Oh, nu vrei friptura, huh?

117
00:11:19,050 --> 00:11:23,550
Stii cate zile stau eu in spatele 
volanului ca sa mananci tu friptura aia?

118
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:25,560
-Sapte.
-Cine ti'a zis asta?

119
00:11:25,850 --> 00:11:26,890
Nimeni. Numar si eu.

120
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:29,060
Tatatl tau vrea sa vorbeasca cu tine.

121
00:11:29,230 --> 00:11:30,230
Despre ce, tata?

122
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,480
Ai fost in bar astazi.

123
00:11:32,690 --> 00:11:33,690
Nu, nu am fost.

124
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:36,230
-Nu minti.
-Am fost in apropiere.

125
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,820
-De ce minti?
-Am aruncat o geana.

126
00:11:38,990 --> 00:11:41,150
-Faci ceva?
-Ce? A aruncat o geana.

127
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,950
-Frumos, fiule.
-Multam, tata.

128
00:11:43,070 --> 00:11:44,700
Lorenzo, vino te rog un pic.

129
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:47,040
Cum pot sa'l impiedic? 
Barul e la doua pasi de noi.

130
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:49,370
Tata are dreptate, asculta'l.

131
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:51,830
-Tu sa taci.
-Da'mi farfuria.

132
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:56,630
Vreau sa ma asculti. Hei!

133
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:58,510
Nu te mai apropia de bar.

134
00:11:58,630 --> 00:12:00,970
Sati pe scari, dar nu langa bar.

135
00:12:01,090 --> 00:12:03,470
-Intr'o zi o sa intelegi.
-Da.

136
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:05,720
Pe mine nu ma vezi acolo.

137
00:12:06,050 --> 00:12:08,930
-Nu ai voie inauntru?
-Ce sa ma fac cu el?

138
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:11,060
Habar nu am.

139
00:12:11,270 --> 00:12:13,690
Glumesc. Nu vreau sa merg acolo.

140
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:21,900
Uite, doua bilete, la meci.

141
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:25,070
-Cu The Mick?
-Da. Acum mananca'ti friptura.

142
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:26,990
Yeah!

143
00:12:31,580 --> 00:12:32,910
Haide Alfie.

144
00:12:33,460 --> 00:12:35,540
'Asta e Phil Vanzatorul-ambulant.'

145
00:12:35,670 --> 00:12:37,880
'Pentru el toata lumea era Mary,

146
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:41,720
si mie si tovarasilor mei ne placea sa i'o coacem.'

147
00:12:43,590 --> 00:12:46,180
'Slick si Mario Nebunu erau 
prietenii mei cei mai buni.'

148
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:51,980
'Slick avea porecla asta din cauza parului.
Mario din cauza ca era nebun.'

149
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:53,770
Yeah-a-oh!

150
00:12:53,890 --> 00:12:57,360
O sa va tabacesc eu curu',
draci mici ce sunteti!

151
00:12:59,110 --> 00:13:00,360
Hai, pleaca de acolo!

152
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:01,990
I'ati mainile de pe fructe!

153
00:13:02,110 --> 00:13:03,900
-Nonorocitilor!
-Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!

154
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:07,120
O sa va snopesc eu! Pe toti trei!

155
00:13:07,370 --> 00:13:08,780
Yeah - a - oh!

156
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,660
O sa va bat de va suna apa in cap!

157
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:16,080
Ia'ti mainile de acolo.
Ce credeti ca sunt maica Tereza?

158
00:13:16,210 --> 00:13:18,880
Duceti'va la parinti sa va dea de mancare,

159
00:13:19,170 --> 00:13:21,460
sau sa va dea la orfelinat.

160
00:13:21,590 --> 00:13:23,420
Nenorocitilor!

161
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:25,680
Cate ai luat?

162
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:30,310
Oh, Coffeecake are necazuri.

163
00:13:31,970 --> 00:13:33,600
Iar o s'o incaseze.

164
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:35,480
Baieti, fiti atenti.

165
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,520
Mario, vino aici. Cine'i ala?

166
00:13:45,450 --> 00:13:48,030
Oh, ala'i Jimmy Whispers.

167
00:13:51,950 --> 00:13:54,290
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Un minut!

168
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:00,170
E ste Sonny.

169
00:14:02,550 --> 00:14:05,420
Iesus! Fa si tu ceva, laudarosule.

170
00:14:05,590 --> 00:14:07,840
Fa ceva mai greu, ca de exemplu Coffeecake.

171
00:14:08,470 --> 00:14:09,680
Nu pot Coffeecake.

172
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:11,140
Este prea greu.

173
00:14:11,260 --> 00:14:16,020
Apara'te cu o plasa, in timp ce eu 
arunc cu cacao in tine.

174
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:18,310
Oh, rahat.

175
00:14:19,730 --> 00:14:22,400
Ciorile astea au tupeu sa vina pe aici.

176
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:24,980
Doar trec pe aici.

177
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,320
De unde stii?

178
00:14:26,530 --> 00:14:27,700
Mi'a spus tata.

179
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:30,870
Tata mi'a spus ca asa a inceput.

180
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:35,750
Plecati naibii din cartierul nostru!

181
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:37,870
Intoarceti'va de unde ati venit.

182
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,580
Noroc ca sunteti in autobuz.

183
00:14:40,790 --> 00:14:44,000
-Vino aici, cioroiule.
-Daca te prind...

184
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:52,430
De ce?

185
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:56,640
Oh, shit!

186
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:06,740
Nu vrei sa te opresti.

187
00:15:06,860 --> 00:15:08,820
Ma lasi?

188
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:11,660
Nimeni nu este ca tine, Sonny.

189
00:15:15,330 --> 00:15:16,870
Ce s'a intamplat cu tine?

190
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,000
Ce faci?

191
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,370
Du'te dracului!

192
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:20,830
Nenorocitule!

193
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:23,710
O sa'ti rup picioarele!

194
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,130
O sa'ti rup capul!

195
00:15:36,890 --> 00:15:38,600
S'o intindem.

196
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:41,140
Da'mi arma.

197
00:15:41,270 --> 00:15:43,190
-In masina!
-Misca!

198
00:15:45,770 --> 00:15:47,070
-Haide!
-Haide!

199
00:15:57,160 --> 00:16:01,460
'Cand s'a uitat Sonny pentru 
prima data la mine am surzit.'

200
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:05,750
'Tot ce mai puteam vedea era Sonny cu arma in mana.'

201
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:27,860
Tata!

202
00:16:30,690 --> 00:16:31,700
Este teafar?

203
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:33,570
Tata, a fost doar un loc de parcare.

204
00:16:34,950 --> 00:16:35,990
Este teafar?

205
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:38,240
-Esti bine?
-Nu are nimic.

206
00:16:38,370 --> 00:16:40,660
-Ce s'a intamplat?
-Sunt bine mama.

207
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:42,370
Oh, m'am speriat asa tare.

208
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:43,670
Sunt bine.

209
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:49,880
Tata se certau pentru un loc de parcare.

210
00:16:50,010 --> 00:16:52,380
-Un loc de parcare?
-Ce este?

211
00:16:52,510 --> 00:16:56,720
-S'au intalnit intr'un loc nepotrivit.
-Putea sa fie omorat.

212
00:16:56,850 --> 00:16:59,350
Lasa'l in pace.

213
00:16:59,890 --> 00:17:01,470
Nu pot sa cred.

214
00:17:05,770 --> 00:17:06,770
Cine este?

215
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:09,730
Politia. Familia Anello?

216
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,610
Mda, cu ce va pot ajuta?

217
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,530
Trebuie sa va intrebam cate ceva.

218
00:17:16,490 --> 00:17:17,490
Despre ce?

219
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:19,370
Deschideti usa.

220
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:26,170
-Va simtiti bine.
-OK.

221
00:17:26,290 --> 00:17:27,540
Bine. Eu sunt detectiv Belsik.

222
00:17:27,670 --> 00:17:30,920
El este detectivul Vella.
buna pustiule. Doamna.

223
00:17:32,130 --> 00:17:33,760
As vrea sa'i pun baiatului cateva intrebari.

224
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,880
Despre ce?

225
00:17:35,010 --> 00:17:37,800
S'au tras niste focuri de arma.
Suspectam ca stie cate ceva.

226
00:17:37,930 --> 00:17:39,140
Chiar?

227
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:40,390
El zice ca nu.

228
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,350
Eu banuiesc ca da. L'au vazut oamenii.

229
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:43,890
Pai, s'or fi inselat.Nu stie nimic.

230
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:45,060
Domnule Anello...

231
00:17:45,190 --> 00:17:49,020
Putem sa sa ingreunam situatia, bine?
Putem sa...

232
00:17:49,150 --> 00:17:50,440
Nu stie nimic.

233
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:51,900
Tata, stiu totul.

234
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:58,570
Copiii, cateodata li se pare.

235
00:17:58,870 --> 00:18:02,790
Noi stim ca fiul dumneavoastra a fost acolo, 
asa ca sa n'o mai lungim.

236
00:18:04,910 --> 00:18:07,670
Pustiule, uite ce vreau sa faci tu.

237
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:11,750
Mergem jos, cu tatal tau 
si ne uitam la niste oameni.

238
00:18:12,630 --> 00:18:18,050
tot ce trebuie sa faci este sa'l 
arati pe omul care a tras.

239
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:19,430
Crezi ca poti?

240
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:30,940
Yeah.

241
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:33,820
Bine. Sa mergem.

242
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:36,610
Domnule Anello, veniti cu noi.

243
00:18:37,740 --> 00:18:39,110
-Nu va dura mult.
-Haideti.

244
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,240
Domnilor, va fi bine?

245
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:43,200
Totul va iesi cu bine.

246
00:19:06,430 --> 00:19:07,430
Asta este.

247
00:19:40,050 --> 00:19:42,720
Bine, domnilor, intoarceti'va.

248
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:47,220
Voi doi, dati'va jos sepcile.

249
00:19:47,350 --> 00:19:49,060
Hei! Frunte sus.

250
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:51,350
capu sus, priviti aici.

251
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:54,190
-El este?
-Nu.

252
00:20:00,820 --> 00:20:01,820
Asta?

253
00:20:02,450 --> 00:20:04,200
Capu sus, amice.

254
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:06,490
-El?
-Nu.

255
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,580
Capu sus.

256
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:10,710
El?

257
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:14,460
Da'mi un raspuns.

258
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:17,000
-El?
-Nu.

259
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,180
Dar el? Asta este?

260
00:20:25,390 --> 00:20:26,390
Raspunde.

261
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:30,810
-Nu.
-OK.

262
00:20:32,390 --> 00:20:34,310
Hey! Put your eyes up.

263
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:37,320
How about this guy?

264
00:20:40,360 --> 00:20:43,240
-It's not him. No.
-No? Let's go.

265
00:20:43,990 --> 00:20:45,660
Hey! Privirea in fata.

266
00:20:48,370 --> 00:20:50,080
Uita'te la mine. Asa!

267
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:51,790
El este?

268
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:56,170
-El?
-Nu.

269
00:20:56,290 --> 00:20:57,290
OK.

270
00:20:59,090 --> 00:21:00,340
Cumva el?

271
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:05,510
Hei! Privirea in fata!

272
00:21:07,430 --> 00:21:10,140
Ce zici? El este?

273
00:21:25,780 --> 00:21:26,780
Raspunde.

274
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:32,330
-Nu.
-Esti multumit, domnule?

275
00:21:32,450 --> 00:21:33,910
-Nu, nu sunt.
-Nu te ajuta...

276
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:36,120
Yeah, se pare ca nu stie nimic.

277
00:21:36,500 --> 00:21:37,500
Zice ca nu stie nimic.

278
00:21:37,630 --> 00:21:40,670
Sa va spun eu ceva : ia plimbati voi ursu. Roiu.

279
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:42,170
Haide baiete, sa mergem.

280
00:21:48,220 --> 00:21:49,800
Voi puteti sa plecati.
Spargeti gasca.

281
00:21:49,930 --> 00:21:51,640
-Roiu.
-Obraznicule.

282
00:21:56,190 --> 00:21:57,730
i'am pacalit tata.

283
00:21:57,850 --> 00:21:59,480
Da, i'am pacalit.

284
00:22:00,150 --> 00:22:02,400
Nu sunt turnator. Nu?

285
00:22:02,530 --> 00:22:03,900
Nuo,mu esti.

286
00:22:05,110 --> 00:22:07,030
Am facut un lucru bun, nu?

287
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,660
Da, asa este.

288
00:22:08,780 --> 00:22:11,660
Ai facut un lucru bun pentru un om rau.

289
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:14,790
'Am facut un lucru bun pentru un om rau.'

290
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:17,460
'Nu intelegeam, cel putin nu la 9 ani .'

291
00:22:18,630 --> 00:22:24,550
'Dar nu am fost cel mai nenoro cit din tot cartieru.
Si nu eram un turnator.'

292
00:22:28,180 --> 00:22:29,180
Hei!

293
00:22:33,390 --> 00:22:34,680
Hei.

294
00:22:40,610 --> 00:22:43,730
De ce zici ca am facut un lucru bun pentru un om rau?

295
00:22:45,780 --> 00:22:50,240
Pentru ca, cateodate trebuie sa 
faci unele chestii, care nu sunt bune.

296
00:22:51,990 --> 00:22:54,580
Intelegi ce zic?

297
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:58,080
Nu, doar ca am crezut ca fac ceva bine,

298
00:22:58,210 --> 00:23:00,460
si acum nu mai cred acest lucru.

299
00:23:00,580 --> 00:23:03,960
Ai facut bine,...intr'o zi ai sa'ti dai seama.

300
00:23:04,090 --> 00:23:06,090
Noi te iubim tare, tare mult.

301
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,470
Maine ai sa vii cu mine cu autobuzul.

302
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:21,690
'City Island era ultima statie din traseul tatei.'

303
00:23:21,810 --> 00:23:24,360
'Era unul din locurile noastre preferate.'

304
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:26,860
'Parca mergeam in vacanta.'

305
00:23:27,530 --> 00:23:32,700
'Tata dorea sa asculte jazz si 
sa vorbim despre basseball.'

306
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:37,700
Imi iei o inghetatat?

307
00:23:38,580 --> 00:23:41,120
Mai intai treaba si apoi inghetata.

308
00:23:41,330 --> 00:23:42,670
-OK?
-OK, tata.

309
00:23:45,750 --> 00:23:47,090
Acolo.

310
00:23:48,420 --> 00:23:50,090
Sa facem un concurs, tat.

311
00:23:50,220 --> 00:23:53,970
OK. Cine a fost jucatorul care 
a castigat de trei ori titlul?

312
00:23:54,100 --> 00:23:55,220
Mickey Mantle.

313
00:23:55,350 --> 00:23:57,470
Numarul de puncte: 353.

314
00:23:57,600 --> 00:23:59,980
RVIs: 130.

315
00:24:00,100 --> 00:24:01,350
Home runs: 52.

316
00:24:02,520 --> 00:24:03,520
Destul de bine.

317
00:24:03,650 --> 00:24:05,730
El este cel mai bun jucator al tuturor timpurilor.

318
00:24:05,860 --> 00:24:08,530
Joe Dee este cel mai bun.

319
00:24:09,070 --> 00:24:12,660
-Inchizatorul de la Yankee. 56 de jocuri.
-Corect.

320
00:24:12,950 --> 00:24:16,790
-Nimeni nu l'a intrecut, nu'i asa?
-Nu, nimeni.

321
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:18,910
Si de ce a fost asa important?

322
00:24:19,040 --> 00:24:20,040
Era italian?

323
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:21,540
Pai, si de asta.

324
00:24:21,670 --> 00:24:23,170
De ce?

325
00:24:23,290 --> 00:24:25,250
Pentru ca avea talent.

326
00:24:25,380 --> 00:24:27,920
-Talent?
-Da, talent.

327
00:24:28,050 --> 00:24:29,960
Eu am talent, tata?

328
00:24:30,090 --> 00:24:32,800
Da, tu esti cel mai talentat.

329
00:24:33,390 --> 00:24:34,510
Voi putea sa joc basseball?

330
00:24:35,470 --> 00:24:37,680
Poti sa faci orice iti doresti.

331
00:24:37,810 --> 00:24:40,520
Talentul este cel mai important 
lucru din lume.

332
00:24:40,930 --> 00:24:44,900
Daca nu stii cum sa'l folosesti, 
atunci il ai degeaba.

333
00:24:45,020 --> 00:24:47,730
Dar daca stii cum sa'l folosesti, 
atunci este perfect.

334
00:24:48,150 --> 00:24:50,530
-Ma auzi?
-Ai dreptate.

335
00:24:50,650 --> 00:24:51,820
Hai sa luam inghetata aia.

336
00:24:51,950 --> 00:24:53,360
Yeah. Bine.

337
00:24:54,610 --> 00:24:56,280
Am sa inchid eu usile, da?

338
00:24:56,410 --> 00:24:57,740
Yeah.

339
00:25:00,750 --> 00:25:01,960
Gata? La doi.

340
00:25:04,670 --> 00:25:06,670
-Ai reusit?
-Da.

341
00:25:08,750 --> 00:25:14,260
'Despre irosirea talentului, 
tata avea sa'mi vorbeasca toata viata.'

342
00:25:14,630 --> 00:25:16,970
Putem sa auzim inceputul meciului.

343
00:25:17,350 --> 00:25:22,520

344
00:25:22,890 --> 00:25:25,060

345
00:25:25,650 --> 00:25:28,020

346
00:25:28,150 --> 00:25:32,360
.

347
00:26:01,010 --> 00:26:04,680

348
00:26:08,860 --> 00:26:11,020
-Ne vedem mai tarziu.
-OK.

349
00:26:16,950 --> 00:26:19,620
Du'te si asculta si restul meciului.

350
00:26:20,160 --> 00:26:21,620
Du'te sus.

351
00:26:21,740 --> 00:26:25,210

352
00:26:30,670 --> 00:26:31,670
Hei, Lorenzo.

353
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:35,220
Condu. Vreau sa'ti spun ceva.

354
00:26:37,050 --> 00:26:40,600
-Pustiul. Bun baiat.
-Multam.

355
00:26:41,010 --> 00:26:43,100
Sonny apreciaza ce ati facut.

356
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:46,060
Si eu sunt fericit ca a iesit bine.

357
00:26:46,180 --> 00:26:47,350
Vrem sa iti multumim.

358
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:51,150
O sa'ti spunem niste cifre si 
tu o sa castigi 150 pe luna.

359
00:26:51,610 --> 00:26:53,020
Nu va mai fi nevoie sa 
conduci autobuzul asta.

360
00:26:53,530 --> 00:26:56,860
Multam, dar imi place munca mea.
Daca fac asta o sa'mi pierd slujba.

361
00:26:57,070 --> 00:27:00,530
-Mai gandeste'te.
-Nu ma intereseaza, nu'i de mine.

362
00:27:00,660 --> 00:27:02,580
150 de parai si nici o grija.

363
00:27:02,740 --> 00:27:05,620
Nu ma intereseaza, nu'i de mine.

364
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:09,000
Sonny va fi dezamagit cand va afla.

365
00:27:09,290 --> 00:27:10,290
OK.

366
00:27:10,420 --> 00:27:12,840
Opreste aici. Vreau sa cobor.

367
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:33,730
-Mi'au oferit o slujba.
-Ca ce?

368
00:27:34,230 --> 00:27:37,650
Pariuri. Ridic niste bilete, le incasez,

369
00:27:37,780 --> 00:27:39,530
si imi iese 150 pe saptamana.

370
00:27:39,990 --> 00:27:41,740
Si ce ai spus?

371
00:27:42,450 --> 00:27:45,660
Tu cam ce crezi?
Am zis ca nu ma intereseaza.

372
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:51,290
Ce?

373
00:27:52,710 --> 00:27:56,050
Nu stiu. 150 de para.
Numai niste pariuri.

374
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:59,920
-Trebuia sa accept?
-Nu stiu.

375
00:28:01,380 --> 00:28:06,600
Dar sa ma inhaitandu'ma cu tipii 
astia, o sa intru in jocul lor.

376
00:28:06,720 --> 00:28:08,060
Nu stiu.

377
00:28:15,650 --> 00:28:17,690
Poate ai dreptate.

378
00:28:19,110 --> 00:28:21,200
Ma duc sa vad ce face copilul.

379
00:28:21,320 --> 00:28:22,410
Vino aici.

380
00:28:22,740 --> 00:28:24,530
-Ce?
-Vino aici.

381
00:28:26,490 --> 00:28:29,500
Iti pare rau ca te'ai incurcat cu un sofer?

382
00:28:30,080 --> 00:28:32,790
-M'am indragostit de uniforma ta.
-Yeah.

383
00:28:42,050 --> 00:28:45,180
'In ziua inmormantarii,
m'am simtit tare prost.'

384
00:28:45,300 --> 00:28:49,850
'Un om a murit si eu am mintit 
despre asta, comitand un pacat.'

385
00:28:49,970 --> 00:28:51,520
'Am vrut ca dumnezeu sa ma ierte.'

386
00:29:02,700 --> 00:29:04,570
Binecuvanteaza'ma parinte caci am gresit.

387
00:29:05,280 --> 00:29:09,330
A trecut mai mult de o luna de 
cand m'am spovedit ultima data.

388
00:29:09,450 --> 00:29:13,670
Am lipsit de doua ori de la slujba,
am mintit intr'un caz de crima,

389
00:29:13,790 --> 00:29:15,040
si am mancat carne vineri.

390
00:29:15,170 --> 00:29:18,040
Poti sa repeti?

391
00:29:19,300 --> 00:29:20,630
Am mancat carne vineri.

392
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:23,130
Nu asta, cealalta.

393
00:29:23,930 --> 00:29:25,340
Am mintit?

394
00:29:25,470 --> 00:29:26,510
Da, aceea.

395
00:29:26,970 --> 00:29:29,060
Intelegi ce ai spus?

396
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:30,930
Dar am mintit numai o data.

397
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:32,600
Ai auzit de amendamentul 5?

398
00:29:33,310 --> 00:29:37,730
Da. Pot sa refuz sa raspund la 
o intrebare care ma poate incrimina.

399
00:29:37,860 --> 00:29:39,230
A cincea porunca.

400
00:29:40,360 --> 00:29:41,690
Sa nu ucizi.

401
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:47,410
Corect. Acum vreau sa'mi spui ce s'a intamplat.

402
00:29:47,530 --> 00:29:50,040
Nu, nu am sa spun asta niciodata.

403
00:29:50,540 --> 00:29:53,580
Nu'ti fie teama.
Dumnezeu este atotputernic.

404
00:29:54,460 --> 00:29:56,080
Asta nu stiu.

405
00:29:56,210 --> 00:29:58,290
Tipul tau este tare in ceruri,

406
00:29:58,420 --> 00:30:00,630
al meu este tare aici pe pamant.

407
00:30:04,130 --> 00:30:07,800
Ai dreptate. Cinci Tatal nostru 
i cinci Ave Maria.

408
00:30:08,050 --> 00:30:10,220
Numai atat, parinte? Foarte bine.

409
00:30:10,350 --> 00:30:12,270
-Ce ai spus?
-La revedere.

410
00:30:13,350 --> 00:30:16,140
'Asta a fost cea mai tare confesiune a mea.'

411
00:30:16,270 --> 00:30:19,060
'Misto sa fii catolic, poti s'o iei 
de la capat in fiecare saptamana.'

412
00:30:28,660 --> 00:30:29,660
Hei, pustiule.

413
00:30:34,410 --> 00:30:38,290
Sonny vrea sa te vada.
Nimeni nu'ti va atinge bicicleta.

414
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:55,310
A sosit pustiul.

415
00:30:55,430 --> 00:30:57,060
Haide, nu te speria.

416
00:31:07,990 --> 00:31:09,860
Ce mai faci piciule?

417
00:31:10,950 --> 00:31:13,080
Bine.

418
00:31:14,330 --> 00:31:16,580
Ne intalnim in sfarsit.

419
00:31:18,580 --> 00:31:19,960
Yeah.

420
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:22,130
Ti'e frica de mine?

421
00:31:23,750 --> 00:31:24,960
-Nu.
-Foarte bine.

422
00:31:26,420 --> 00:31:27,420
Cum te cheama?

423
00:31:28,170 --> 00:31:30,220
Calogero.

424
00:31:30,890 --> 00:31:33,300
Cam lung. Nu ai o porecla?

425
00:31:33,430 --> 00:31:34,760
Nu.

426
00:31:36,310 --> 00:31:37,810
Si prietenii cum te striga?

427
00:31:37,930 --> 00:31:39,640
Calogero.

428
00:31:39,770 --> 00:31:41,270
Acum inteleg.

429
00:31:42,480 --> 00:31:44,070
esti fan al lui Yankee?

430
00:31:44,190 --> 00:31:45,650
Yeah.

431
00:31:47,530 --> 00:31:48,820
Stai jos.

432
00:31:50,990 --> 00:31:54,530
Nu, vino aici si stai langa mine.

433
00:31:59,790 --> 00:32:02,920
Cred ca esti dezamagit ca au pierdut, nu?

434
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:05,340
Ben Lazeroski - il urasc.

435
00:32:06,460 --> 00:32:10,300
El l'a facut pe Mickey Mantle sa planga.
Asa zic ziarele, ca Mick a plans.

436
00:32:10,510 --> 00:32:12,970
Esti cuparat pe Mickey Mantle?

437
00:32:13,090 --> 00:32:16,560
El primeste 100.000 pe an.
Tatal tau cat primeste?

438
00:32:16,850 --> 00:32:19,100
-Nu stiu.
-Nu ?

439
00:32:19,730 --> 00:32:22,810
Du'te si cere'i lui Mickey Mantle 
sa va plateasca chiria, si vezi ce zice.

440
00:32:23,270 --> 00:32:28,860
Lui nu'i pasa de tine, asa ca,
de ce sa ne pese noua de el?

441
00:32:30,110 --> 00:32:31,450
Pot sa te intreb ceva?

442
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,200
Desigur.

443
00:32:34,490 --> 00:32:37,910
L'ai impuscat pe omul acela,
pentru locul de parcare?

444
00:32:42,250 --> 00:32:44,540
Cand vei fi mai mare vei intelege.

445
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:48,920
Mm-hm.

446
00:32:49,380 --> 00:32:54,260
'Din acea zi nu ma'a mai interesat atat de mult Yankees.'

447
00:32:54,390 --> 00:32:58,640

448
00:33:01,770 --> 00:33:04,100

449
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:07,980

450
00:33:08,780 --> 00:33:11,030

451
00:33:11,150 --> 00:33:13,740

452
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:17,080
'Imi petreceam mult timp alaturi de Sonny.'

453
00:33:18,370 --> 00:33:22,710
'Trebuia sa stau acasa dupa ore, 
dar ma furisam de cate ori puteam.'

454
00:33:22,830 --> 00:33:27,670
'Ii serveam pe tipi cu cafea,
si ei imi lasau bacsise.'

455
00:33:34,380 --> 00:33:36,090
-Arunca'le!
-Haide.

456
00:33:37,600 --> 00:33:41,180
-Cacanarule!
-Nu pot sa cred.

457
00:33:42,270 --> 00:33:44,270
Uite, asta este pentru tine.

458
00:33:44,690 --> 00:33:46,520
Sonny, imprumuta'mi o batrana.

459
00:33:46,650 --> 00:33:48,190
Haide, am o presimtire.

460
00:33:48,310 --> 00:33:49,730
Haide, o simt.

461
00:33:49,860 --> 00:33:50,860
Dai o foaie.

462
00:33:51,030 --> 00:33:54,570
-Uite 100 de para.I'ai.
-Si eu joc. Si eu joc.

463
00:33:56,360 --> 00:33:57,870
Este cald ca naiba.

464
00:33:58,780 --> 00:34:00,740
OK, Mush, arata ce poti.

465
00:34:00,870 --> 00:34:02,750
-Haide, da cu zaru'.
-Pariez 25.

466
00:34:02,870 --> 00:34:05,080
Papusa are nevoie de incaltari.

467
00:34:05,210 --> 00:34:07,170
Haide. Sapte.

468
00:34:07,290 --> 00:34:11,340
Haide cu tata. Am nevoie de un sapte.

469
00:34:11,460 --> 00:34:12,550
Nu vreau sa ma uit.

470
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,630
Fir'ar sa fie! Am plecat.

471
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:15,760
Scoateti'l afara.

472
00:34:16,130 --> 00:34:19,010
Afara! Afara!

473
00:34:19,140 --> 00:34:21,310
Nu a castigat in viata lui.

474
00:34:21,640 --> 00:34:22,720
Niciodata!

475
00:34:23,180 --> 00:34:25,020
Da'mi zarurile.

476
00:34:25,140 --> 00:34:26,900
Unde este pustiul?

477
00:34:27,270 --> 00:34:29,060
Trece'mi cafeau la...

478
00:34:29,190 --> 00:34:31,690
O s'o trec la datorii, numai cara'te afara.

479
00:34:31,820 --> 00:34:33,230
-Unde e piciu?
-Gradinita!!!

480
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:35,490
Piciul o sa le arunce.

481
00:34:35,990 --> 00:34:39,870
-Nu'l lasa.
-E vreo problema cu asta?

482
00:34:40,490 --> 00:34:42,990
Bine, nu este nici o problema.

483
00:34:43,200 --> 00:34:44,410
Huh?

484
00:34:44,540 --> 00:34:46,870
Haide, arunca zarurile.

485
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,290
Nu pot, Sonny.

486
00:34:48,420 --> 00:34:51,420
Nu este nimic, doar asculta'ma,
ma auzi ce zic?

487
00:34:51,540 --> 00:34:52,590
-OK.
-Doar asculta.

488
00:34:53,050 --> 00:34:55,590
Bine, 500 de pare pe pici.

489
00:34:55,720 --> 00:34:57,260
-Eu 100.
-500!

490
00:35:00,220 --> 00:35:01,260
Intru si eu.

491
00:35:04,470 --> 00:35:07,770
Hei! Vrei sa nu te mai freci de mine?

492
00:35:07,890 --> 00:35:10,020
Ma sufoci!

493
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:11,650
-Hei, Georgio.
-Calmeaza'te.

494
00:35:11,770 --> 00:35:13,860
Si eu vreau sa joc, stii?

495
00:35:15,190 --> 00:35:17,400
Izbeste'le de zid, piciule. Poti s'o faci.

496
00:35:17,530 --> 00:35:18,910
Izbeste'le de zid.

497
00:35:19,030 --> 00:35:21,740
-Stai, stai, stai.
-Poti s'o faci.

498
00:35:21,870 --> 00:35:23,740
Pariez pe Sonny.

499
00:35:23,870 --> 00:35:25,870
Hei! Nu vreau ca banii tai,
sa fie langa banii mei.!

500
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:28,370
-Ce?
-Nu vreau ca banii tai...

501
00:35:28,500 --> 00:35:29,920
Nu sunt buni sau de ce?

502
00:35:30,040 --> 00:35:34,090
De ce? Pentru ca esti un ghinionist 
notoriu. Inchideti'l in baie.

503
00:35:34,210 --> 00:35:35,880
Afara cu el!

504
00:35:38,090 --> 00:35:40,590
-Afara!
-Looseru naibii!

505
00:35:40,720 --> 00:35:41,850
Nenorocitul!

506
00:35:42,600 --> 00:35:43,600
Lasati'l acolo!

507
00:35:46,060 --> 00:35:47,230
Ghinionistul naibii!

508
00:35:48,810 --> 00:35:50,190
It's a lot of money.

509
00:35:51,060 --> 00:35:53,940
-Arunca zarurile!
-Izbeste'le de zid.

510
00:35:54,980 --> 00:35:56,280
-Bine!
-Yeah!

511
00:36:00,910 --> 00:36:02,530
Ada zarurile.

512
00:36:04,080 --> 00:36:05,290
Aici.

513
00:36:07,540 --> 00:36:09,580
Pariez 100.

514
00:36:11,330 --> 00:36:12,670
Poti s'o faci.

515
00:36:12,790 --> 00:36:14,380
Bine? Poti s'o faci.

516
00:36:14,500 --> 00:36:17,630
Georgio, nu mai respira asupra mea.

517
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:20,180
Inceteaza, intelegi?

518
00:36:20,300 --> 00:36:21,300
Duceti'l in baie.

519
00:36:21,430 --> 00:36:23,510
Sonny, nu va incapea.

520
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,600
Nu'mi pasa!

521
00:36:35,190 --> 00:36:36,270
Sunt o groaza de bani.

522
00:36:38,360 --> 00:36:41,320
-Izbeste'le.
-Arunca'le odata.

523
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:44,910
Dam patru.

524
00:36:45,030 --> 00:36:46,240
Bine. Bine.

525
00:36:47,990 --> 00:36:49,620
Au noroc.

526
00:36:49,750 --> 00:36:51,710
Mai arunca'le o data.

527
00:36:51,830 --> 00:36:55,460
Ce Au banii mei?
Ce, a innebunit?

528
00:36:57,380 --> 00:37:00,170
Pariez pe un patru al pustiului.
Inca 500.

529
00:37:00,300 --> 00:37:01,720
-Eu pun 200.
-Inca 500.

530
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:04,890
-200.
-22 pentru un patru din dubla.

531
00:37:05,010 --> 00:37:06,010
-OK.
-Pun 100.

532
00:37:06,300 --> 00:37:08,970
-Cine a pus 40?
-Nu acceptam asa ceva.

533
00:37:09,100 --> 00:37:10,520
-40 pentru.
-Lasa'i jos.

534
00:37:10,640 --> 00:37:13,730
-Nu va da niciodata patru din dubla.
-Niciodata.

535
00:37:14,190 --> 00:37:15,860
Trebuie sa dai, poti sa dai.

536
00:37:15,980 --> 00:37:19,110
-Nici o problema, dau sapte.
-Nu!

537
00:37:19,230 --> 00:37:22,070
-Yeah, un sapte.
-Taci!

538
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:23,610
-Hei!
-Il crezi pe pusti?

539
00:37:23,780 --> 00:37:26,870
Hei, nimeni sa nu rada de el, da?

540
00:37:26,990 --> 00:37:28,660
Sapte nu este bun acum.

541
00:37:28,910 --> 00:37:30,200
-Haide pustiule.
-Loveste zidul.

542
00:37:30,870 --> 00:37:33,000
Trebuie sa castigam.

543
00:37:33,670 --> 00:37:37,630
Nu, nu, nu.
Frankie Coffeecake, nu este bine.

544
00:37:37,750 --> 00:37:41,510
Nu vreau sa'l sperie pe pusti.Nu, nu, nu.

545
00:37:41,630 --> 00:37:44,340
Jimmy, adu un prosop.
Pune'i'l pe fata.

546
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:47,220
Haide, Sonny, este neplacut.

547
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:49,510
Duceti'l in baie!

548
00:37:50,100 --> 00:37:53,180
Asteapta un pic. Whoa! 
Am si eu bani aici.

549
00:37:53,310 --> 00:37:55,230
Duceti'l de aici.

550
00:37:55,560 --> 00:37:58,020
Scutiti'ma de prezenta lui.

551
00:38:01,280 --> 00:38:04,450
-Ultimele pariuri.
-Ce are?

552
00:38:05,490 --> 00:38:07,240
Haide, tre' sa castigam.

553
00:38:07,740 --> 00:38:12,200
Asculta'ma. Vezi banii aia?
Castigam?

554
00:38:12,330 --> 00:38:14,160
Haide.

555
00:38:14,710 --> 00:38:16,540
-Haide.
-Poti s'o faci.

556
00:38:16,670 --> 00:38:19,170
-Avem nevoie de 2-2 sau de un 1-3.
-Nu te infoia asa.

557
00:38:20,550 --> 00:38:21,840
-Trebuie doar sa castigam.
-Dat dracu' pustiu.

558
00:38:22,010 --> 00:38:24,380
Sa castigam. Haide.

559
00:38:26,550 --> 00:38:29,850
-Nu imi vine sa cred!
-A reusit!

560
00:38:29,970 --> 00:38:32,770
'11. De unsprezece ori la rand am castigat.'

561
00:38:35,520 --> 00:38:38,650
'Nu stiu cat a castigat Sonny in seara aia, 
dar erau o gramada de bani.'

562
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:50,160
'Mi'a zis ca o sa merg la cea mai buna scoala din lume:
Belmont Avenue university.'

563
00:38:50,280 --> 00:38:54,450
'Voi primi o educatie in strada
si una la scoala,

564
00:38:54,580 --> 00:38:57,620
si voi fi de doua ori mai istet.'

565
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:11,930
Hei, pustiule.

566
00:39:12,680 --> 00:39:13,680
Te'ai descurcat bine.

567
00:39:13,810 --> 00:39:15,060
Multumesc.

568
00:39:15,180 --> 00:39:16,390
Uite.

569
00:39:18,520 --> 00:39:19,520
Ce este aici?

570
00:39:21,560 --> 00:39:22,650
Uite.

571
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:25,780
Bine?

572
00:39:27,150 --> 00:39:28,490
Du'te acas. Este tarziu.

573
00:39:28,610 --> 00:39:29,990
Ne mai vedem noi, Sonny.

574
00:39:34,330 --> 00:39:35,330
Asculta.

575
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:39,830
Trebuie sa facem ceva cu numele tau.

576
00:39:41,630 --> 00:39:43,130
De acum inaonte numele tau este C.

577
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:45,460
-C?
-Exact, C.

578
00:39:46,010 --> 00:39:47,170
Du'te acasa. Haide.

579
00:39:47,720 --> 00:39:49,050
La revedere, Sonny.

580
00:39:50,260 --> 00:39:54,680
Sonny ma lua peste tot- si ma numea fiul lui- 
si lucruri ciudate au inceput sa se intample.

581
00:39:57,310 --> 00:40:01,480
Hei, Calogero. Vreau sa vorbesc cu tine.

582
00:40:02,860 --> 00:40:04,190
Numele meu este C.

583
00:40:05,070 --> 00:40:06,400
Vreau sa zic C.

584
00:40:07,690 --> 00:40:09,900
Cum ti'a mers astazi?

585
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:11,030
Bine.

586
00:40:11,160 --> 00:40:13,490
am niste piersici pentru mama ta.

587
00:40:13,950 --> 00:40:15,700
Nu am nici un ban Phil.

588
00:40:15,830 --> 00:40:19,080
Nici nu trebuie sa'mi dai, pustiule.

589
00:40:19,210 --> 00:40:22,330
Sa nu ma mai luati la misto niciodata.

590
00:40:23,290 --> 00:40:26,550
Spunei doar lui Sonny ca am avut grija de tine.

591
00:40:27,340 --> 00:40:28,340
OK.

592
00:40:32,180 --> 00:40:33,180
'Asta chiar m'a miscat.'

593
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:37,100
'Sonny era motivul pentru care ma tratau asa.'

594
00:40:37,220 --> 00:40:38,560
'Si imi placea.'

595
00:40:39,350 --> 00:40:40,980
'Chiar foarte mult.'

596
00:40:45,440 --> 00:40:48,440
Mama,uite ce am.
Niste piersici pentru tine...

597
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:50,360
...gratis.

598
00:41:00,250 --> 00:41:02,670
-Ce este?
-Ce este ce, tata?

599
00:41:03,120 --> 00:41:06,040
De unde ai astia?

600
00:41:07,090 --> 00:41:08,250
Am economisuit.

601
00:41:08,420 --> 00:41:11,720
600 de para? Ai devenit neurochirurg?

602
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:14,090
Spune'i lu' tac'tu de unde ii ai.

603
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:16,680
-Am muncit.
-Ce anume?

604
00:41:17,060 --> 00:41:18,260
-Chestii.
-Chestii?

605
00:41:18,890 --> 00:41:20,480
Ce chestii?

606
00:41:21,180 --> 00:41:22,440
Tot felul. Nimicuri.

607
00:41:22,560 --> 00:41:26,980
Hei, nu ma minti. Spune adevarul 
si n'o sa ma supar.

608
00:41:28,020 --> 00:41:29,730
-Promiti?
-Sunt tatal tau.

609
00:41:29,860 --> 00:41:31,780
As spune'o daca nu ar fi asa?

610
00:41:33,570 --> 00:41:35,570
Am primit bacsis la jocuri.

611
00:41:36,070 --> 00:41:38,410
-La jopcuri?
-Ce jocuri?

612
00:41:38,620 --> 00:41:40,200
Ce bacsis?

613
00:41:41,250 --> 00:41:44,370
-Ce jocuri?
-Ai spus ca nu te enervezi.

614
00:41:44,500 --> 00:41:45,790
Am mintit. Spune totul.

615
00:41:46,380 --> 00:41:49,130
-Am lucrat pentru Sonny.
-Stiam eu.

616
00:41:50,090 --> 00:41:52,670
Nu ti'am spus de atatea ori 
sa nu te apropii de bar?

617
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:53,880
dar am lucrat pentru ei.

618
00:41:54,010 --> 00:41:55,840
Ce vrei sa spui ai lucrat?

619
00:41:55,970 --> 00:41:58,470
Ii duc inapoi.

620
00:41:58,600 --> 00:42:00,060
Sa ne mai gandim.

621
00:42:00,600 --> 00:42:02,060
Ce zici?

622
00:42:02,180 --> 00:42:05,520
Am putea folosi banii astia.
Nu provin din ceva rau.

623
00:42:05,650 --> 00:42:07,520
Nu asta este esentialul.

624
00:42:07,650 --> 00:42:08,820
Nu vreau sa am bani proveniti de acolo.

625
00:42:08,940 --> 00:42:09,980
Asculta'ma un minut.

626
00:42:10,110 --> 00:42:11,570
-Sa discutam despre...
-Gata.

627
00:42:11,820 --> 00:42:14,030
-Haide.
-Stai. Asculta.

628
00:42:15,950 --> 00:42:20,160
Lorenzo, de ce te  aprinzi asa?
Calmeaza'te.

629
00:42:20,290 --> 00:42:22,200
Lorenzo. Te rog.

630
00:42:23,250 --> 00:42:24,580
Nu pot sa cred asta.

631
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:31,050
Lorenzo.

632
00:42:32,880 --> 00:42:34,720
Lorenzo, te rog.

633
00:42:43,390 --> 00:42:44,640
Este Sonny p'aci?

634
00:42:44,770 --> 00:42:47,270
Ihi. Este in spate.

635
00:42:57,820 --> 00:43:01,910
-Nu putem accepta asta.
-I'am dat pustiului, nu tie.

636
00:43:02,040 --> 00:43:07,000
-Da, si nu vreau ca fiul meu sa intre in chestia asta.
-In ce?

637
00:43:07,120 --> 00:43:10,130
Nu sunt cretin. Te rog.

638
00:43:10,250 --> 00:43:12,800
Lasa'l in pace,doar.

639
00:43:12,920 --> 00:43:16,220
Hei! Stai asa. C, du'te afara, 
vreau sa vorbesc cu tatal tau.

640
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:20,220
Eu ii spun ce sa faca.
Calogero, asteapta'ma afara.

641
00:43:22,640 --> 00:43:26,230
Te respect Lorenzo, esti un om cu caracter,

642
00:43:26,430 --> 00:43:28,060
dar sa nu'mi mai vorbesti niciodata asa.

643
00:43:28,810 --> 00:43:30,900
-Il sfatuiesc pe fiul tau sa mearga la scoala...
-Tu nu intelegi.

644
00:43:31,020 --> 00:43:33,020
Nu este vorba de ce ii spui, 
ci de ce  vede.

645
00:43:33,150 --> 00:43:35,400
Sunt hainele, masinile, banii,...
totul.

646
00:43:36,360 --> 00:43:39,820
Si'a aruncat echipamentul de basseball zicand ca 
Mickey Mantle nu vrea sa ne plateasca chiria.

647
00:43:41,160 --> 00:43:43,490
A zis el asta? Nu'mi vine sa cred.

648
00:43:43,950 --> 00:43:47,870
Nu este amuzant, nu cand copilul la noua ani, 
are mai multi bani decat tatal sau.

649
00:43:48,210 --> 00:43:49,870
Ti'am oferit o slujba si i'ai dat cu piciorul.

650
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:53,250
Si acum tot nu o sa zic.
Lasa'l pe pusti in pace.

651
00:43:53,380 --> 00:43:54,590
Hei!

652
00:43:54,710 --> 00:43:57,220
Il consider pe fiul tau fiul meu.

653
00:43:57,340 --> 00:43:58,720
Nu itit este tie fiu.

654
00:43:58,970 --> 00:44:00,220
-Este ce?
-Este fiul meu.

655
00:44:00,340 --> 00:44:01,340
Iesi afara!

656
00:44:01,550 --> 00:44:03,260
-Nu imi este frica de tine.
-Ar trebui.

657
00:44:03,470 --> 00:44:06,680
Stiu de ce esti capabil, 
stiu care este drumul meu,

658
00:44:06,810 --> 00:44:09,190
dar de data asta gresesti.

659
00:44:09,310 --> 00:44:11,860
Nu poti sa ma pacalesti pe mine.

660
00:44:11,980 --> 00:44:13,020
Vrei sa na batem?

661
00:44:13,150 --> 00:44:15,730
-Sa'l lasi in...
-Iesi afara!

662
00:44:16,110 --> 00:44:18,110
-Lasa'l in pace.
-Haide!

663
00:44:18,240 --> 00:44:20,450
-Lasa'l!
-Iesi afara!

664
00:44:21,700 --> 00:44:23,490
-Unde sunt banii mei, tata?
-I'am lasat acolo.

665
00:44:23,620 --> 00:44:25,870
Ce? Dar erau banii mei tata...

666
00:44:26,450 --> 00:44:28,580
Erau bani murdari.

667
00:44:28,710 --> 00:44:29,750
Tata, am muncit pentru...

668
00:44:29,870 --> 00:44:31,620
Am zis sa'l lasi in pace.

669
00:44:31,750 --> 00:44:32,750
Tata, asculta...

670
00:44:32,880 --> 00:44:34,290
Am zis sa'l lasi in pace.

671
00:44:34,420 --> 00:44:35,670
Tata, asculta.

672
00:44:35,920 --> 00:44:37,920
Ai auzit? Lasa'l in pace!

673
00:44:38,760 --> 00:44:42,010
Sonny are dreptate.
Ala care munceste este fraierul.

674
00:44:42,220 --> 00:44:43,220
Greseste.

675
00:44:43,350 --> 00:44:47,390
Este usor sa apesi pe tragaci,
mai greu este sa muncesti.

676
00:44:47,520 --> 00:44:50,190
Sa'l vedem la munca, acolo tot asa tare este?

677
00:44:50,310 --> 00:44:54,230
Ala care munceste este tipul tare.
Si eu sunt ala!

678
00:44:54,360 --> 00:44:57,730
Oamenii il iubesc. Pe tine nu te iubesc?
Este acelasi lucru.

679
00:44:57,860 --> 00:44:58,900
nu este acelasi lucru.

680
00:44:59,030 --> 00:45:03,950
Oamenii nu'l indragesc, ei se tem de el.
Asta este diferenta.

681
00:45:05,780 --> 00:45:06,990
Nu inteleg, tata.

682
00:45:08,910 --> 00:45:11,670
vei intelege. Dar cand vei fi mai mare.

683
00:45:12,710 --> 00:45:14,580
Imi pare rau ca te'am lovit.

684
00:45:39,320 --> 00:45:41,570
Vrei sa'l aranjez?

685
00:45:41,700 --> 00:45:43,610
Nu, lasa'l in pace.

686
00:45:44,530 --> 00:45:47,830
'Sonny si tata nu si'au mai vorbit de atunci.'

687
00:45:47,950 --> 00:45:51,370
'Si nici eu nu am ascultet sfaturile lui."

688
00:45:51,500 --> 00:45:55,170
'Tentatia era prea aproape ca s'o pot pierde.'

689
00:45:55,290 --> 00:45:59,710
'Au trecut opt ani si asa cum am crescut eu, 
a crescut si puterea lui Sonny.'

690
00:45:59,840 --> 00:46:03,300
'A devenit un boss si eu eram prietenul lui.'

691
00:46:06,800 --> 00:46:08,720
# It's a beautiful morning

692
00:46:09,680 --> 00:46:15,150
# And I think I'll go outside the wire

693
00:46:18,190 --> 00:46:22,280
'Era 1968 si Dione erau in top.'

694
00:46:22,690 --> 00:46:24,740
'The Beatles erau in mare voga.'

695
00:46:24,860 --> 00:46:28,120
'Yankees erau pe ultimul loc, 
dar mie nu'mi pasa.

696
00:46:28,240 --> 00:46:32,290
'Peste tot se schimbase cate ceva,
numai in cartierul meu nu.'

697
00:46:33,460 --> 00:46:37,040
"Si au plecat!
Kryptonite conduce."

698
00:46:38,670 --> 00:46:40,630
Bine, uite ca vine pustiul.

699
00:46:41,380 --> 00:46:42,380
C, vino aici.

700
00:46:42,510 --> 00:46:43,510
-Le ai?
-Yeah.

701xxx
00:46:43,630 --> 00:46:44,630
-Totul pentru Kryptonite.
-Asa!

702
00:46:44,760 --> 00:46:45,930
-Ce?
-Frumos.

703
00:46:46,930 --> 00:46:50,680
Uita'te la calul asta.
Haide! Uita'te la el.

704
00:46:51,770 --> 00:46:54,890
-Nu poate sa piarda.
-Poti, Kryptonite!

705
00:46:55,020 --> 00:46:58,360
Uita'te, frumos.
Nici sa nu iti faci probleme.

706
00:46:59,230 --> 00:47:02,150
Nici nu trebuie sa te uiti,
nu putem sa nu castigam.

707
00:47:02,980 --> 00:47:04,280
Uite se distanteaza.

708
00:47:05,400 --> 00:47:07,780
-Haide, Kryptonite!
-Haide, Kryptonite!

709
00:47:07,910 --> 00:47:09,990
Uita'te si tu, s'a terminat.

710
00:47:10,120 --> 00:47:12,660
-S'a terminat.
-Sa mergem.

711
00:47:13,040 --> 00:47:15,580

712
00:47:16,330 --> 00:47:19,580
Haide. Haide, Kryptonite!
Haide

713
00:47:19,710 --> 00:47:23,460
Haide, Kryptonite!
Lupta'te, Kryptonite!

714
00:47:23,590 --> 00:47:24,630
-Oh, la naiba.
-Haide!

715
00:47:26,300 --> 00:47:27,970
A pariat pe calul asta?

716
00:47:28,090 --> 00:47:29,140
Pe Kryptonite?

717
00:47:29,260 --> 00:47:30,510
Da'mi biletele.

718
00:47:30,680 --> 00:47:32,140
Dar Sonny, castigam.

719
00:47:32,470 --> 00:47:36,270
Nu putem daca a pariat pe Kryptonite. Ghinion!

720
00:47:37,600 --> 00:47:38,600
Dar conduce.

721
00:47:38,730 --> 00:47:40,060
Avem ghinion.

722
00:47:40,190 --> 00:47:41,730
Haide, Kryptonite! Haide!

723
00:47:42,110 --> 00:47:43,530
Haide!

724
00:47:45,190 --> 00:47:46,650
Nenorocitul naibii.

725
00:47:47,030 --> 00:47:48,860
Poti s'o mai faci.

726
00:47:48,990 --> 00:47:50,070
Haide, Kryptonite!

727
00:47:50,240 --> 00:47:52,490
-Haide, Kryptonite!
-Haide!

728
00:47:52,620 --> 00:47:53,700
Rezista!

729
00:47:53,830 --> 00:47:55,500
Haide, castigatorule.

730
00:47:56,120 --> 00:47:58,420
Rezista! Rezista!

731
00:47:58,540 --> 00:47:59,870
Nu! Nu!

732
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:01,790
Nu! Pe naiba!

733
00:48:03,750 --> 00:48:06,670
Asa de aproape si totusi am pierdut.

734
00:48:06,800 --> 00:48:08,380
-Am pierdut.
-Nenorocitul.

735
00:48:08,510 --> 00:48:09,510
Nu pot sa cred.

736
00:48:09,630 --> 00:48:12,510
C, am un pont pentru cursa urmatoare.

737
00:48:12,640 --> 00:48:14,970
Pai, dute'n ma'ta!

738
00:48:15,100 --> 00:48:17,640
Oh, te emotionezi prea repede.

739
00:48:20,310 --> 00:48:23,520

740
00:48:23,980 --> 00:48:26,940
# If you want...

741
00:48:28,860 --> 00:48:31,870
# Something to play with

742
00:48:31,990 --> 00:48:35,330
# Go and find yourself a car... #

743
00:48:35,450 --> 00:48:40,290
'A infiintat in sfarsit un club,
numit The Deuces Wild.'

744
00:48:40,420 --> 00:48:43,920
'Bauturile costau un dolar 
si tonomatul muzical acoperea chiria.'

745
00:48:44,040 --> 00:48:45,800
'Tot ce faceam era sa trandavim.'

746
00:48:47,300 --> 00:48:49,880
'Nu mai mergeam la ore si ne adunam acolo.'

747
00:48:50,010 --> 00:48:53,680
'Nimeni nu vroia sa plece acasa...

748
00:48:53,800 --> 00:48:58,140
pentru ca te trezeai a doua zi ca ai scapat ceva.'

749
00:49:00,270 --> 00:49:03,940
Whoa! Whoa! Tipii. Whoa!
Uitati ce tipe.

750
00:49:04,060 --> 00:49:07,780
-Sunt misto.
-Haideti aici, frumoaselor.

751
00:49:08,440 --> 00:49:10,570
Iubire, vino aici, vino.

752xxx
00:49:10,700 --> 00:49:12,070
Vieni qua, dammi un bacio.

753
00:49:19,750 --> 00:49:22,290
-Haide, stai jos.
-Va funculo!

754
00:49:22,750 --> 00:49:25,210
-Tipele astea sunt niste nenorocite.
-De unde sti?

755
00:49:25,920 --> 00:49:26,920
Du'te naibii, C.

756
00:49:27,050 --> 00:49:28,250
De unde?

757
00:49:28,380 --> 00:49:29,710
Au picat testul mau.

758
00:49:29,840 --> 00:49:32,430
-Ce test?
-Cum se numeste?

759
00:49:32,550 --> 00:49:36,510
Ca sa vezi daca o tipa merita s'o iei 
de nevasta, tre sa treaca testul.

760
00:49:36,640 --> 00:49:38,470
Il numesc testul Mario.

761
00:49:38,600 --> 00:49:40,480
Trebuie sa'l aud.

762
00:49:40,640 --> 00:49:43,560
O iei pe tipa la plimbare cu masina, corect?

763
00:49:43,690 --> 00:49:44,690
Yeah.

764
00:49:44,810 --> 00:49:45,810
Iesi de pe autostrada,

765
00:49:45,940 --> 00:49:49,690
si te opresti langa un 
camion din ala mare.

766
00:49:49,820 --> 00:49:52,570
Parchezi langa el si te asiguri 
ca soferul este atent la tine.

767
00:49:52,700 --> 00:49:56,240
Clacsonezi daca este necasar, 
numai sa se uite tipul.

768
00:49:56,370 --> 00:50:02,000
In acelasi timp incepi sa'i impingi 
capul intre picioarele tale.

769
00:50:02,120 --> 00:50:04,830
-Ma lasi?
-Yeah.

770
00:50:04,960 --> 00:50:05,960
Este pentru binele ei.

771
00:50:06,290 --> 00:50:09,420
Acum, daca fata se apuca de treaba,

772
00:50:09,550 --> 00:50:11,800
stiind ca se uita si soferul,

773
00:50:11,920 --> 00:50:13,590
atunci nu este de incredere.

774
00:50:13,720 --> 00:50:16,720
-Nu merge.
-Esti bolnav, ai nevoie de ingrijiri.

775
00:50:16,850 --> 00:50:21,520
Si daca isi dau parul dupa ureche, 
inseamna ca au mai facut'o pana atunci.

776
00:50:21,640 --> 00:50:23,690
Credeti'ma, sunt profesioniste.

777
00:50:39,620 --> 00:50:42,700
Ciorile astea au mai trecut 
de doua ori pe aici.

778
00:50:42,870 --> 00:50:44,330
Cui ii pasa?

779
00:50:44,460 --> 00:50:47,670
Ce vorbesti? Mie imi pasa.

780
00:50:48,080 --> 00:50:50,250
Te deranjeaza? Nu.

781
00:50:50,380 --> 00:50:54,300
Dar saptamana viitoare vor fi doua masini
si inainte sa'ti dai seama...

782
00:50:54,420 --> 00:50:55,430
o sa se culce si cu tipele alea.

783
00:50:55,550 --> 00:50:57,340
Nu mai trebuie sa treaca pe aici.

784
00:50:57,470 --> 00:51:00,060
Sa ii invitam la o cafteala.

785
00:51:00,470 --> 00:51:02,180
Sa'i cotonogim.

786
00:51:08,770 --> 00:51:11,780
Louie! Haide incoace.
Unde'mi sunt banii?

787
00:51:11,900 --> 00:51:13,740
Sti, ma cam grabesc.

788
00:51:13,860 --> 00:51:15,400
-Cacat!
-Ce este?

789
00:51:15,530 --> 00:51:18,070
Tipu imi datoreaza 20 de para.

790
00:51:18,200 --> 00:51:20,780
Nu poti sa ma ocolesti la nesfarsit!

791
00:51:21,160 --> 00:51:22,830
Cacanarul naibii.

792
00:51:32,590 --> 00:51:34,510
Tovarasii, ma intorc imediat.

793
00:51:34,960 --> 00:51:36,760
-Bine.
-Bine.

794
00:51:36,880 --> 00:51:38,680
-Ne mai vedem.
-Sa te intorci.

795
00:51:44,640 --> 00:51:46,480
Haide cu mine la o plimbare.

796
00:51:46,690 --> 00:51:49,350
-Este neaparata nevoie?
-Da, desigur.

797
00:51:57,150 --> 00:51:58,700
Stai aolo.

798
00:52:07,580 --> 00:52:10,290
Tata, chiar trebuie sa ascultam asta?
Ma doare deja capul.

799
00:52:10,420 --> 00:52:13,340
Voi tineretul de astazi,
nu mai intelegeti muzica.

800
00:52:13,460 --> 00:52:15,130
Asta este muzica ca lumea.

801
00:52:16,460 --> 00:52:20,840

802
00:52:23,810 --> 00:52:26,470
Mergi maine la lupte?

803
00:52:27,270 --> 00:52:28,730
Calogero?

804
00:52:30,310 --> 00:52:31,440
Calogero?

805
00:52:32,860 --> 00:52:35,650
Hei, ma auzi? Calogero?

806
00:52:37,860 --> 00:52:39,950
Tata, de ce nu'mi zici C?

807
00:52:40,160 --> 00:52:42,820
Pentru ca asta a fost numele bunicului tau.

808
00:52:42,910 --> 00:52:45,740
de aia nu pot sa'ti spun C.

809
00:52:48,580 --> 00:52:51,080
Vrei sa mergi sau nu?

810
00:52:52,420 --> 00:52:53,920
Pot sa'ti spun maine?

811
00:52:54,040 --> 00:52:57,010
Vreau sa'mi spui acum,
asa ca mergi sau nu?


812
00:52:57,210 --> 00:52:58,210
Bine, am sa merg.

813
00:52:58,630 --> 00:53:02,430
Nu o spune doar as.
Nu vreau sa'ti rasucesc mana.

814
00:53:25,620 --> 00:53:27,660

815
00:54:09,620 --> 00:54:13,250
Era inalta, frumoasa,
si avea classa...

816
00:54:14,870 --> 00:54:16,130
dar era neagra...

817
00:54:18,960 --> 00:54:21,630
si in cartierul meu nu era dorita.

818
00:54:40,780 --> 00:54:42,320
Jackie, ce este mai important?

819
00:54:42,440 --> 00:54:44,110
La ora doi, baieti.

820
00:54:44,240 --> 00:54:45,990
Doi. Numarul prietenilor.

821
00:54:46,110 --> 00:54:48,200
-Al cui?
-Al tau.

822
00:54:48,320 --> 00:54:49,700
Nu mai glumi.

823
00:54:49,830 --> 00:54:52,160
-Bush a marcat 228?
-asa este.

824
00:54:52,290 --> 00:54:53,460
-Din nou?
-Da.

825
00:54:54,460 --> 00:54:57,790
O sa incerc sa am altceva mai bun data viitoare.

826
00:54:57,920 --> 00:55:00,090
Am glumit. Este buna si asta.

827
00:55:05,180 --> 00:55:06,220
Pe mai tarziu.

828
00:55:26,450 --> 00:55:27,450
Louie!

829
00:55:27,700 --> 00:55:29,620
E bolnava bunica'mea.

830
00:55:29,740 --> 00:55:33,200
Vorbim mai tarziu.
Am ceva treaba acum.

831
00:55:33,330 --> 00:55:34,410
Unde'mi sunt banii?

832
00:55:37,460 --> 00:55:39,460
O sa te stalcesc cand o sa te prind, nenorocitule!

833
00:55:39,580 --> 00:55:43,050
-C! Vino aici!
-Ce s'a intamplat?

834
00:55:43,170 --> 00:55:45,220
-Haide aici.
-s'a enervat.

835
00:55:45,340 --> 00:55:47,590
Hei, pustiul isi vrea banii inapoi,
asa ca ce vrei sa faci?

836
00:55:47,720 --> 00:55:48,840
O sa vorbesc cu el.

837
00:55:50,100 --> 00:55:51,430
Nu il mai dadaci atata.

838
00:55:53,140 --> 00:55:54,430
Ii datoreaza bani.

839
00:55:54,890 --> 00:55:57,730
-Loveste'l cu o bata.
-Omoara'l.

840
00:55:57,850 --> 00:55:59,940
Ce fel de sfat este asta?

841
00:56:00,060 --> 00:56:02,320
-batrausilor.
-Nu il mai dadaci.

842
00:56:02,440 --> 00:56:06,280
-Haide sa intram inauntru.
-Nu ii asculta pe indivizii astia.

843
00:56:06,400 --> 00:56:07,400
O sa revin.

844
00:56:07,530 --> 00:56:08,530
Bine.

845
00:56:09,820 --> 00:56:11,620
Ce s'a intamplat?

846
00:56:11,740 --> 00:56:13,740
Louie Dumps imi datoreaza 20 de para.

847
00:56:13,870 --> 00:56:18,210
De doua saptamani ma tot duce cu zaharelul.

848
00:56:18,330 --> 00:56:21,750
-Da?
-Sa il pleznesc sau nu?

849
00:56:21,880 --> 00:56:24,670
Ce s'a intamplat? Ce ti'am zis?

850
00:56:24,800 --> 00:56:27,590
Cateodata a rani oamenii, 
nu este cea mai buna solutie.

851
00:56:27,720 --> 00:56:29,050
Iti este prieten?

852
00:56:29,180 --> 00:56:30,720
Nu, nici macar nu'l agreez.

853
00:56:30,840 --> 00:56:33,890
Nu il agreezi. Asta este raspunsul.

854
00:56:34,010 --> 00:56:36,980
Uite, pentru 20 de para vrei sa'l aranjezi.

855
00:56:37,350 --> 00:56:41,060
Nu'ti va mai cere bani niciodata
si nu te va mai deranja.

856
00:56:41,190 --> 00:56:43,940
Iese din viata ta pentru 20 de para.
Pentru atata nu se merita.

857
00:56:44,110 --> 00:56:46,030
Da, ai intotdeauna dreptate.

858
00:56:46,150 --> 00:56:47,400
Da, intotdeauna.

859
00:56:47,530 --> 00:56:50,280
Daca as fi avut intotdeauna 
nu as fi facut 10 ani inchisoare.

860
00:56:50,410 --> 00:56:52,490
Ce faceai in fiecare zi?

861
00:56:52,620 --> 00:56:55,200
Pai puteai sa faci trei lucruri.

862
00:56:55,330 --> 00:56:57,540
Sa tragi de fiare, sa joci carti
sau s'o cauti cu lumanarea.

863
00:56:57,660 --> 00:56:58,960
Si tu ce ai facut?

864
00:56:59,080 --> 00:57:00,210
Eu? Am citit.

865
00:57:01,540 --> 00:57:03,250
Ce anume?

866
00:57:03,380 --> 00:57:05,380
-Ai auzit de Machiavelli?
-Cine?

867
00:57:05,500 --> 00:57:09,380
Machiavelli. A fost un 
scriitor celebru acum 500 de ani.

868
00:57:09,510 --> 00:57:11,890
Disponibilitate, asta spunea mereu.

869
00:57:12,010 --> 00:57:13,640
-Disponibilitate?
-Corect.

870
00:57:13,760 --> 00:57:14,760
Asculta'ma.

871
00:57:15,850 --> 00:57:18,270
Ai idee de ca traiesc eu aici?

872
00:57:19,180 --> 00:57:20,230
Disponibilitate.

873
00:57:20,770 --> 00:57:22,940
Vreau sa stau aproape de tot.

874
00:57:23,060 --> 00:57:25,650
Fiind aici, pot mirosi
primejdia imediat.

875
00:57:26,190 --> 00:57:27,900
Primejdia este precum cancerul.

876
00:57:28,030 --> 00:57:31,240
Trebuie sa reactionezi repede,
inainte de a te omora.

877
00:57:31,650 --> 00:57:33,160
Trebuie s'o inlaturi.

878
00:57:33,910 --> 00:57:36,160
Intelegi? Haide.

879
00:57:36,950 --> 00:57:42,330
Iti faci probleme pentru Louie Dumps.
Nimanui nu'i pasa.Nimanui nu'i pasa.

880
00:57:42,460 --> 00:57:45,000
Fa'ti griji pentru tine, pentru familie
si pentru prieteni.

881
00:57:47,630 --> 00:57:50,010
Asta se reduce la disponibilitate.

882
00:57:50,130 --> 00:57:53,680
Oamenii care ma vad zilnic,
sunt de partea mea,,

883
00:57:53,800 --> 00:57:58,720
se simt in siguranta pentru ca sunt aproape,
si au un motiv in plus sa ma iubeasca.

884
00:57:59,100 --> 00:58:02,390
Dar cei care nu vor acelasi lucru,
se gandesc de doua ori,

885
00:58:02,520 --> 00:58:06,730
pentru ca stiu ca sunt aproape
si au un motiv in plus de ingrijorare.

886
00:58:07,150 --> 00:58:09,150
Este mai bine sa fi temut sau iubit?

887
00:58:10,820 --> 00:58:12,740
It's a good question.

888
00:58:12,860 --> 00:58:15,410
Este misto sa fii si una si alta
dar este dificil.

889
00:58:15,530 --> 00:58:19,660
Daca as putea sa aleg,
as prefera sa fiu de temut.

890
00:58:20,870 --> 00:58:23,420
Teama dureaza maui mult decat iubirea.

891
00:58:23,540 --> 00:58:25,880
Prietenia legata prin bani, 
nu valoreaza nimic.

892
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:30,880
Daca zici un banc, toata lumea rade.
Sunt hazliu si nu prea.

893
00:58:32,340 --> 00:58:36,140
Teama ii tine loiali,
dar secretul este sa nu te urasca.

894
00:58:37,050 --> 00:58:39,140
Ii tratez bine, 
dar nu foarte bine.

895
00:58:39,260 --> 00:58:44,270
Le dau destul cat sa aiba nevoie de mine,
dar nu sa ma si urasca.

896
00:58:46,230 --> 00:58:48,020
Nu uita asta.

897
00:58:50,440 --> 00:58:53,240
Sonny, avem o vacuta superba azi,

898
00:58:53,740 --> 00:58:55,910
si niste linguini super.

899
00:59:42,290 --> 00:59:44,160
astia nu sunt imbracati corespunzator 
pentru localul acesta.

900
00:59:44,500 --> 00:59:46,410
-Corespunzator?
-ce s'a intamplat?

901
00:59:46,540 --> 00:59:49,710
-Ce este?
-I'am rugat sa plece.

902
00:59:49,830 --> 00:59:50,960
Este vreo problema?

903
00:59:51,090 --> 00:59:55,010
Problema este ca tipul tau zice ce nu suntem 
imbracati corespunzator pentru localul asta.

904
00:59:55,130 --> 00:59:57,930
-Vrem doar cateva beri.
-Doar atat?

905
00:59:58,390 --> 00:59:59,680
Apoi o intindem.

906
00:59:59,800 --> 01:00:02,310
Nu o cautam cu lumanarea.

907
01:00:02,430 --> 01:00:04,680
Bine, serviti'i.

908
01:00:04,810 --> 01:00:05,810
-Multimim.
-Nici o problema.

909
01:00:12,440 --> 01:00:14,320
Aveti bautura?

910
01:00:14,440 --> 01:00:16,240
Aliniaza'le, haide o data.

911
01:00:17,320 --> 01:00:21,410
-Doua aici, da?
-Imi dai si mie una?

912
01:00:21,870 --> 01:00:23,740
Inca una, inca una te rog.

913
01:00:26,080 --> 01:00:30,210
Bine, Buzz, vreau sa inchinam
pentru gazdele noastre.

914
01:00:30,380 --> 01:00:33,670
In numele tatalui, al fiului 
si al sfantului duh!

915
01:00:36,670 --> 01:00:38,930
Uite se mi'ati facut!

916
01:00:40,550 --> 01:00:41,890
Hei!

917
01:00:42,640 --> 01:00:43,930
Oh, iarasi tu?